WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Uncle Chen, prepare afternoon tea and refreshments

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,000
Let's all drink some tea and calm down.

3
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:07,650
grandpa, grandma

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,450
Don’t you have anything to say to Yoyo?

5
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:11,450
Grandpa Lu and Grandma Lu said

6
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:13,250
Say sorry for doing something wrong

7
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,050
This is a good baby

8
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,450
Yoyou, it was your grandparents who misunderstood you.

9
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,050
We will compensate you

10
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:21,050
Yes, yes, Yoyo, what toy do you want?

11
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,250
Grandma will buy it for you

12
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:24,250
Grandpa and grandma, you said it doesn’t matter.

13
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:25,450
How can you make your elders apologize?

14
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:26,650
How can there be such a reason in the world?

15
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,650
Okay, Yoyo, I’m still busy at home.

16
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,250
We, Youyou, are the most sensible, right?

17
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:38,650
Yoyo, I didn’t expect my grandparents to be shocked for the sake of face.

18
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:40,850
Not even willing to say sorry

19
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,700
Yoyo, my aunt knows you are sad

20
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:52,900
However, there are some things that my aunt wants to tell you

21
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:56,240
If you are real, everyone can step on you

22
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,640
If you are strong, a great scholar will become better for you.

23
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,040
Your value is never determined by whether others love you or not.

24
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:03,240
Focus on your skills and keep your core stable

25
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:05,240
You will no longer suffer from the love and hate of others

26
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:07,440
Auntie, Yoyo is a three-and-a-half-year-old boy with a hat

27
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:08,840
What you said is too profound
